<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .otp-box { 
            background: #f4f4f4; 
            padding: 15px; 
            text-align: center; 
            font-size: 32px; 
            font-weight: bold; 
            letter-spacing: 8px; 
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            color: #6d28d9;
            user-select: all;
            -webkit-user-select: all;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #6d28d9;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .btn-container { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
        <p>Hello,</p>
        <p>You requested to reset your password for your Semantix account. Please copy the One-Time Password (OTP) below to proceed:</p>
        
        <div class="otp-box">{{otp}}</div>
        
        <div class="btn-container">
            <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="btn" style="color: #ffffff;">Reset Your Password</a>
        </div>
        
        <p>This code will expire in <strong>10 minutes</strong>.</p>
        <p>If you did not request this change, please ignore this email.</p>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Thank you,<br>The Semantix Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>